  message: "INV-tafig (violated, P2) is the SAME SHAPE OF GAP on a different field -- the io_boundary VALUE axis (fs_read/net_send/...) is also absent from _known_axes() with no registry, axiom or drift linter. Related, not duplicate: that item is about the boundary vocabulary, this one about the module key. If the human rules (a) or (b) here, the two should be scoped together -- they would share the registry pattern and the drift-linter shape."  # f52c
